{
  "title": "Aromatic Spicy Malaysian Pork Curry",
  "description": "A spicy and crumbly Malaysian dish featuring tamarind paste, render-fat, and ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients, this curry is a nostalgic and flavorful meal option.",
