      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to brown.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pork cubes and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the tamarind paste, curry powder, cumin powder, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the lid and continue to simmer for an additional 10 minutes, or until the pork is tender and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with roti."
  ],
